            <description><![CDATA[<h2>PS Nest 1.2.1 — Clearer workspace</h2>
<ul>
<li>Larger text, clearer headings and more room around controls.</li>
<li>NAS and Trello import tools expand when needed.</li>
<li>Longer guidance is grouped under clearly named help sections.</li>
<li>Result measurements are easier to scan, with detailed sheet dimensions one click away.</li>
<li>The offcut switch remains prominent. Cutting settings and nesting calculations are unchanged.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
